# An apple thrown at the pot (kind $42) that kind $20's guard with $07 bit 4
# carries (as cov_kind20_carrier_hit.box: the first level, the guard at
# $0BAB restarted with $07 $13, the pot at $0BFB): Aladdin put at x $00D0,
# 27 pixels up (y $0195), throws right as he falls, so the apple (record
# $09CB) flies at the pot's height, above the guard's box: the carried
# pot's ActorDownedByHarmlessShot ($83:8208) is touched. The apple made harmless in
# flight (its $11 = $80) and Aladdin's $2F ($090A) held at $0B: the pot is
# turned the other way ($83:821B), and goes into state $8C.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 000BB2 13
poke 000BAB 0C
wait 5
poke 0008E7 D0,00
poke 0008EA 95,01
hold RIGHT 2
press A
poke 0009DC 80
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 1
poke 00090A 0B
wait 50
